    "title": "Kuaishou’s Kling AI lines up CICC, Goldman Sachs and UBS for a $1 billion Hong Kong IPO",
    "summary": "Kling AI's IPO could redefine market valuations for AI video tech, influencing strategic dynamics among major tech investors and competitors.\nThe post Kuaishou’s Kling AI lines up CICC, Goldman Sachs and UBS for a $1 billion Hong Kong IPO appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
